  "rationale": "label_proxy is outcome-based (what happened 60 min after the spike), not a prediction. We prioritise clear outcomes (continuation/reversal) for early evaluation of the agentic debate system, while keeping a small high-strength unclear slice (~10-15%) to represent genuine uncertainty / sideways consolidation. Per-ticker quotas and temporal de-duplication prevent concentration in volatile names or single macro-shock days. Strength scoring uses per-ticker robust scaling (median/IQR) so volatile stocks like TSLA and NVDA do not dominate the selection."
